{
  "project": {
    "name": "Cowl-Neck Top",
    "slug": "cowl-neck-top",
    "version": "0.1.0",
    "engine": "fc",
    "description": {
      "en": "A relaxed top whose front neckline rises above the shoulder into a self-facing that folds back into a soft cowl — no separate collar. The front shoulder matches the back exactly, so the shoulder seam balances by construction; cut in a fluid fabric for the drape. A soft-goods garment — no hardware. FC-200 long-tail (silhouette gap).\n\nOfficial visualizer and configurator: Fashion Cabinet",
      "es": "Un top holgado cuyo escote frontal se eleva por encima del hombro en una vista propia que se dobla en una caída suave (cowl) — sin cuello aparte. El hombro frontal coincide exactamente con la espalda, así que la costura de hombro se equilibra por construcción; córtese en tela fluida para el drapeado. Una prenda textil — sin herrajes. Cola larga FC-200 (hueco de silueta).\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Fashion Cabinet",
      "fr": "Un haut décontracté dont l'encolure devant s'élève au-dessus de l'épaule en une parementure à même qui se replie en un col bénitier souple — sans col séparé. L'épaule devant correspond exactement au dos, de sorte que la couture d'épaule s'équilibre par construction ; à couper dans un tissu fluide pour le drapé. Un vêtement textile — sans quincaillerie. Longue traîne FC-200 (lacune de silhouette).\n\nVisualiseur et configurateur officiel : Fashion Cabinet"
    },
    "difficulty": "intermediate",
    "tags": [
      "cowl",
      "top",
      "draped",
      "knit",
      "commons",
      "made-to-measure"
    ],
    "attribution": {
      "author": "Innovaciones MADFAM",
      "license": "CERN-OHL-W-2.0",
      "lineage": [
        {
          "source": "Original draft for Fashion Cabinet",
          "license": "original"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "modes": [
    {
      "id": "set",
      "label": {
        "en": "Full Top",
        "es": "Top completo",
        "fr": "Haut complet"
      },
      "script_file": "main.py",
      "pieces": [
        "front",
        "back"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pieces": [
    {
      "id": "front",
      "label": {
        "en": "Front (cowl)",
        "es": "Frente (cowl)",
        "fr": "Devant (col bénitier)"
      },
      "default_color": "#5a6a7a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "back",
      "label": {
        "en": "Back",
        "es": "Espalda",
        "fr": "Dos"
      },
      "default_color": "#5a6a7a",
      "cut": {
        "quantity": 1,
        "on_fold": true,
        "fold_edge": "center",
        "mirror": true
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameter_groups": [
    {
      "id": "body",
      "label": {
        "en": "Body Measurements",
        "es": "Medidas Corporales",
        "fr": "Mesures du corps"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fit",
      "label": {
        "en": "Fit & Style",
        "es": "Ajuste y Estilo",
        "fr": "Coupe et style"
      }
    }
  ],
  "parameters": [
    {
      "id": "chest_girth",
      "type": "slider",
      "group": "body",
      "default": 980,
      "min": 650,
      "max": 1500,
      "step": 10,
      "measurement": {
        "standard": "iso_8559",
